                              UN/EDIFACT

                UNITED NATIONS STANDARD MESSAGE (UNSM)

                        Transport instruction message

                                           Message Type : IFTMIN
                                           Version      : D
                                           Release      : 20B
                                           Contr. Agency: UN

Function: This message is used to request transport instructions.
Note: Fixture note for IFTMIN.

4.3.1  Segment table

Pos    Tag Name                                      S   R

0010   UNH Message header                            M   1
0020   BGM Beginning of message                      M   1
0030   DTM Date/time/period                          C   5
0040       Segment group 1: RFF-DTM                   C   5
0050           RFF Reference                           M   1
0060           DTM Date/time/period                    C   5
0070           Segment group 2: NAD-CTA-COM            C   3
0080               NAD Name and address               M   1
0090               CTA Contact information            C   2
0100               COM Communication contact          C   5
